  "instruction": "Look at `mixed.sch`, add a zero-ohm resistor named `R_TIE` that bridges `AGND` and `DGND`, and save the result as `/home/user/Desktop/answer.sch`. Requirements: 1. `/home/user/Desktop/answer.sch` must parse as well-formed XML. 2. A `<part name=\"R_TIE\">` must exist. 3. The `AGND` net must contain `<pinref part=\"R_TIE\" pin=\"1\"/>`. 4. The `DGND` net must contain `<pinref part=\"R_TIE\" pin=\"2\"/>`. 5. `C1` and `C2` must remain connected to `AGND`. 6. `R1` and `R2` must remain connected to `DGND`. 7. `AGND` and `DGND` must remain separate nets.",
